  "notes": "`wrap_up` takes nothing and is cast into `signal`'s `void (*)(int)` slot, and `main` also calls it directly. A declared prototype closes the parameter list, so parking it would materialize that argument at the direct call site out of whatever register was live -- an invented assignment and an invented argument, neither of which is in the program.",
  "probe_id": "p-159b6045ce5b"
}
